cff-version: 1.2.0
type: software
title: AOP-Suite
version: v0.0.1
date-released: 2026-04-16
license: MIT

abstract: >
  AOP-Suite is a web-based tool for building, visualizing, and analyzing Adverse Outcome Pathway (AOP) networks. 
  It serves as an extended user interface for pyAOP and the AOP-Wiki RDF SPARQL endpoint. 
  The AOP Network Builder allows to build AOP Networks: query AOP Wiki RDF data and construct biological pathway networks;
  integrate Multiple Data Sources by combining data from AOP Wiki, UniProt, Ensembl, Bgee, OpenTargets, and more; and
  provides an interactive Visualization with Cytoscape.js for dynamic network visualization with customizable layouts.
  Users can add Bgee gene expression data, QSPR predictions, and GO process annotations.


